      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Over time, Torrey shifted from an agricultural community to a gateway for tourists exploring Capitol Reef National Park's red rock formations.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.torreyutah.gov/history",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The area also holds significance in Native American history, with evidence of ancient inhabitants dating back thousands of years.",
